  "question": {
    "text": "A block of mass 25 kg is pulled along a horizontal surface by a force at an angle $45^{\\circ}$ with the horizontal. The friction coefficient between the block and the surface is 0.25. The displacement of 5 m of the block is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "970 J",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "735 J",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "245 J",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "490 J",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0009_a2320aceeb20.png\"/><br/>Block travels with uniform velocity<br/>So $\\quad \\mathrm{a}=0 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{~F} \\cos 45^{\\circ}=$ friction<br/>$\\begin{aligned}<br/>& \\frac{\\mathrm{F}}{\\sqrt{2}}=\\mu\\left[\\mathrm{mg}-\\frac{\\mathrm{F}}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right] \\\\\n& \\frac{\\mathrm{F}}{\\sqrt{2}}=0.25\\left[25 \\times 9.8-\\frac{\\mathrm{F}}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right] \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\quad 1.25 \\frac{\\mathrm{~F}}{\\sqrt{2}}=61.25 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~F}=\\frac{61.25 \\times \\sqrt{2}}{1.25}=49 \\sqrt{2} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~W}_{\\mathrm{ext}}=\\mathrm{FS} \\cos 45^{\\circ} \\\\\n&=49 \\sqrt{2} \\times 5 \\times \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}=245 \\mathrm{~J}<br/>\\end{aligned}$"
  }
}